  "name": "Knight Inlet Acoustic Doppler Current Profiler data, 1995",
  "description": "Acoustic doppler current profiler data, current meter data, thermistor chain data of Knight Inlet in 1995. Sill area in particular, time-series data, yo-yo CTD data.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Constructing models of circulation in Knight Inlet\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Data not secured in regional data centre . Risk of Loss: Medium Impact Justification: Data used for one time analysis. Impact of Loss: Low Recommended Action: Bring data to archives.",
